# Optional public build-time configuration; never put secrets here.
# API default: /api (an explicitly empty assignment selects the origin root).
VITE_API_BASE_URL
# Geocoder default: https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search (light use only).
# Use a shared rate-limited proxy or another provider before multi-user deployment.
VITE_GEOCODER_URL
# Staff/supervisor tokens are entered through Modo personal and kept in tab memory.
# Never define VITE_STAFF_TOKEN or VITE_SUPERVISOR_TOKEN (Vite exposes all VITE_* values).
# The API configures STAFF_TOKEN/SUPERVISOR_TOKEN on the server, outside this folder.
